WEBVTT

00:15.974 --> 00:17.976
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.837 --> 00:48.381
Who… are you?

00:48.465 --> 00:49.799
Who do you think I am?

00:51.342 --> 00:52.969
I'm a soul shifter who has blue mark…

00:54.220 --> 00:55.221
within my eyes.

00:55.930 --> 00:56.765
What?

00:56.848 --> 00:58.808
As soon as my blue mark reappeared…

01:00.977 --> 01:02.353
I remembered who I really am.

01:05.982 --> 01:07.192
Jin Bu-yeon isn't the real me.

01:09.694 --> 01:10.737
I was someone else…

01:13.323 --> 01:14.449
who came into this body.

01:15.658 --> 01:16.493
A stranger?

01:16.576 --> 01:18.787
I was trying to run away
so I wouldn't get caught.

01:21.414 --> 01:22.499
But in the end, you still saw me.

01:26.503 --> 01:27.462
So what will you do?

01:29.464 --> 01:30.298
[Go Won] Jang Uk.

01:30.799 --> 01:32.133
[footsteps approaching]

01:36.596 --> 01:37.639
You found her?

01:38.348 --> 01:39.808
Yeah, I did. She's safe now.

01:39.891 --> 01:42.101
She's not hurt at all?
Are you all right, shaman?

01:42.185 --> 01:44.229
[Jang Uk] She just got startled
when the wraiths charged her.

01:44.312 --> 01:45.313
She's calming down.

01:46.481 --> 01:47.398
So you don't need to worry.

01:47.482 --> 01:50.068
Yeah. There are wraiths here, right?

01:50.151 --> 01:51.611
This forest is so dreary.

01:53.863 --> 01:56.741
[soft tense music playing]

02:03.665 --> 02:05.750
No one can see it
unless they're this close.

02:07.377 --> 02:10.213
What's next… is up to me.

02:11.089 --> 02:12.048
Let no one else find out.

02:12.632 --> 02:13.466
Only I'm…

02:14.217 --> 02:15.343
allowed to be…

02:16.928 --> 02:17.929
this close.

02:21.224 --> 02:22.058
Fine.

02:25.019 --> 02:26.104
So only you…

02:28.022 --> 02:28.898
can come this close.

02:33.820 --> 02:34.904
[Master Lee] Are you saying…

02:34.988 --> 02:37.240
that Naksu has come to realize
who she truly is?

02:37.323 --> 02:38.992
[Ho-gyeong] That is how it seemed to me.

02:39.075 --> 02:43.246
Now that Naksu has her memory,
will her soul leave that body

02:43.329 --> 02:46.249
and finally allow Bu-yeon
to come back entirely?

02:47.083 --> 02:48.042
Seo Yul told me.

02:50.170 --> 02:52.964
I won't fault you for deceiving me.
Tell me the truth.

02:53.548 --> 02:54.883
If, by some chance,

02:54.966 --> 02:57.760
Bu-yeon's soul fully returns
while she's in Gwido,

02:57.844 --> 03:00.972
would she… be able
to come out of there alive?

03:01.764 --> 03:02.849
She'll be just fine.

03:02.932 --> 03:05.226
That soul that shares the body with Naksu

03:05.310 --> 03:08.813
has such tremendous power
that I could never have imagined.

03:08.897 --> 03:10.064
[exhales heavily]

03:15.570 --> 03:17.739
The wraith that attacked me
came from this corpse.

03:17.822 --> 03:19.991
All the other wraiths would flee
when I'd get close.

03:20.783 --> 03:22.660
[Bu-yeon]
But the one from this body chased me.

03:22.744 --> 03:24.162
What is that blue shiny thing inside?

03:25.413 --> 03:28.124
[suspenseful music playing]

03:31.377 --> 03:33.296
This is an ice stone.

03:33.379 --> 03:36.090
An ice stone?
There was one in here this whole time?

03:36.174 --> 03:38.843
That ice stone is missing
the energy of the sky.

03:38.927 --> 03:40.386
It's different than the one Jang Uk has.

03:40.470 --> 03:43.348
Like a soul shifter that's run wild,

03:43.431 --> 03:45.183
this ice stone seeks human energy.

03:45.266 --> 03:46.726
[Jang Uk] It's best that we let it be.

03:48.770 --> 03:50.813
[Go Won] If this person died
in Gwido with an ice stone,

03:50.897 --> 03:52.774
then this must be a mage
from the Choi family.

03:54.192 --> 03:57.070
That mage held a grudge
against Jin Seol-ran.

03:57.570 --> 04:00.156
It must have attacked you
because you are of the Jin family.

04:00.657 --> 04:01.491
That must be.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.660
It must have recognized
the Jin family's blood

04:04.202 --> 04:05.328
that flows through this body.

04:08.081 --> 04:09.207
But how did you two…

04:10.208 --> 04:12.585
- get into Gwido then?
- Didn't you summon us here?

04:12.669 --> 04:13.544
Summon you?

04:14.587 --> 04:15.797
- I did?
- Yes.

04:15.880 --> 04:18.549
After I saw you go in,
I told Jang Uk immediately.

04:18.633 --> 04:20.802
And since you summoned us,
we came to rescue you.

04:20.885 --> 04:24.347
You and Jin Mu made me go in here,
now you're here to rescue me?

04:24.931 --> 04:26.933
So you went all the way
to the North Fortress

04:27.016 --> 04:28.476
to tell Jang Uk I was in Gwido?

04:30.103 --> 04:30.937
Actually,

04:32.063 --> 04:33.314
I didn't go there at all.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.110
And I never sided with Jin Mu either.

04:37.986 --> 04:39.320
Yeah, I'm on his side.

04:40.071 --> 04:42.031
[quirky music playing]

04:42.115 --> 04:43.950
You don't need
to literally stand at my side.

04:44.951 --> 04:45.785
Don't move.

04:47.203 --> 04:48.955
I suggested we work together
in the first place

04:49.038 --> 04:50.290
because I am the Prince.

04:50.373 --> 04:51.582
[sighs]

04:53.543 --> 04:56.129
[Go Won] What I mean is that I'll hide
behind Jin Mu like you said,

04:56.212 --> 04:57.755
and you will go far away.

04:59.799 --> 05:00.967
It sounds like you're saying that…

05:01.050 --> 05:03.970
I need to be far away to begin
whatever your scheme is for Jin Mu.

05:04.053 --> 05:04.887
Right.

05:05.680 --> 05:09.350
I'll remain by his side and discover
the truth to the power that he holds.

05:09.434 --> 05:10.768
You mean his secret organization?

05:10.852 --> 05:13.688
All the soul shifters that he's made
with the Soul Ejector

05:13.771 --> 05:15.273
continue to aid him.

05:16.107 --> 05:17.275
[Go Won]
I don't know how many are out there

05:17.358 --> 05:18.318
or who they are.

05:18.985 --> 05:22.780
But they're desperate for the ice stone
to prevent themselves from running wild.

05:23.698 --> 05:25.491
In order to stop what he's planning,

05:26.159 --> 05:27.744
we must wipe out his organization.

05:27.827 --> 05:30.830
And the only one who can do that
isn't me, but you, Jang Uk.

05:30.913 --> 05:33.082
- [suspenseful music playing]
- So are you…

05:33.958 --> 05:35.626
asking me to join forces with you?

05:40.089 --> 05:41.924
First, tell them you'll go up north.

05:42.008 --> 05:43.885
Then, return here.

05:43.968 --> 05:46.137
I'll gather all the soul shifters
that you've been after,

05:46.220 --> 05:48.639
so that way, you'll be able
to kill them all at once very easily.

05:50.641 --> 05:53.519
You could obtain incredible power
if you only stand with Jin Mu.

05:55.104 --> 05:57.106
So why did you decide to go against him?

05:57.190 --> 05:59.025
[suspenseful music continues playing]

06:02.570 --> 06:04.447
Because he's the one
who got rid of my turtle.

06:07.283 --> 06:08.117
Your turtle?

06:08.201 --> 06:10.620
I can't claim
it's because of some great cause

06:10.703 --> 06:12.455
like saving the world or something.

06:12.538 --> 06:14.290
But when he threw out my turtle…

06:16.959 --> 06:18.628
I made the decision to get rid of him.

06:23.216 --> 06:24.050
What?

06:25.176 --> 06:27.095
You don't believe I'd turn on him
over my turtle?

06:27.178 --> 06:28.012
Getting rid of him

06:28.096 --> 06:30.348
because he wouldn't allow you
to have some turtle

06:30.431 --> 06:32.809
sounds more believable
than claiming it was for some great cause.

06:32.892 --> 06:35.103
- [quirky music playing]
- [sighs]

06:35.186 --> 06:37.188
So then, did you find the cute little guy?

06:43.361 --> 06:44.487
It's nowhere to be found.

06:45.113 --> 06:46.614
It's a clever creature

06:46.697 --> 06:48.407
so it's capable of finding its way home.

06:48.491 --> 06:50.451
[somber music playing]

06:50.535 --> 06:51.661
I'm worried that it died.

06:58.084 --> 07:00.086
[quirky music playing]

07:06.384 --> 07:10.888
[Sun] I appoint Jang Uk of the Jang family
as the general of North Fortress.

07:10.972 --> 07:14.100
People won't know
that you never went to North Fortress.

07:15.101 --> 07:17.186
I put someone on the boat
you were meant to board.

07:17.270 --> 07:18.563
So no one will find out

07:19.313 --> 07:21.399
you're not on the boat
until it arrives at its destination.

07:22.275 --> 07:25.069
Stay here and wait
until Jin Mu makes his move.

07:26.195 --> 07:28.114
Dang-gu and Yul said they'd come visit.

07:28.197 --> 07:30.491
I mean, couldn't they have found
a cleaner place that I could stay in?

07:30.575 --> 07:32.368
This is just-- Come on, just look!

07:32.452 --> 07:34.287
- This is so…
- Oh, there're so many cobwebs here, Sire.

07:35.538 --> 07:38.916
His Highness appears
to also find this place unsuitable.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.626
[Go Won] There are still cobwebs
all over the place.

07:40.710 --> 07:41.544
[Eunuch Oh] Sire, careful going down.

07:41.627 --> 07:43.254
[Go Won]
How am I supposed to get through here?

07:43.337 --> 07:44.547
[grunts]
Seriously?

07:44.630 --> 07:45.465
You were complaining

07:45.548 --> 07:46.924
- that he was slowly crawling…
- [Go Won] Who put these spiders in here?

07:47.008 --> 07:48.009
- …toward you.
- Get rid of them!

07:48.092 --> 07:49.093
- [Eunuch Oh] Yes, Sire.
- [Go Won] Ah, there's another one.

07:49.177 --> 07:50.344
- And now you decided to let him in.
- [Go Won groans in disgust]

07:50.428 --> 07:53.097
He said he didn't want us to continue
to keep our swords pointed at each other.

07:53.681 --> 07:56.309
So I told him to just stop bothering me
and to let me do what I must.

07:57.018 --> 07:57.894
[Jang Uk] Come on.

08:00.313 --> 08:01.189
[Go Won sighs]

08:04.066 --> 08:07.069
Songrim remains loyal
to Jang Uk and supports him.

08:08.404 --> 08:09.322
I shall…

08:09.947 --> 08:11.449
stay hidden and prepare the way.

08:11.532 --> 08:13.534
[thrilling music playing]

08:15.828 --> 08:18.456
Bring them along
with the King's gifts from the volcano.

08:18.539 --> 08:20.291
Jin Mu's goods
will be transported by a boat

08:20.374 --> 08:22.043
that is carrying gifts for the King.

08:22.793 --> 08:24.879
- Let it pass through without inspection.
- Okay.

08:24.962 --> 08:26.172
We will have to place them

08:26.255 --> 08:27.965
throughout the canals
before the lake's rite.

08:29.050 --> 08:31.344
Would you be able to help with that, Sire?

08:31.427 --> 08:33.846
I'll be sure to inform the men
that stand the Night Watch.

08:34.388 --> 08:35.306
So you may use them.

08:35.890 --> 08:37.808
This map marks everywhere
that the Night Watch has placed

08:37.892 --> 08:39.018
the earthenware across Daeho.

08:39.101 --> 08:42.522
Later, we can retrieve
all the earthenware in those locations.

08:43.064 --> 08:46.567
The earthenware is going to help
the fire bird become stronger

08:46.651 --> 08:47.527
once it awakens.

08:48.194 --> 08:50.530
This is like
someone adding fuel to a fire.

08:52.031 --> 08:55.159
Once the Assembly begins,
Jin Mu will try to take over Jinyowon.

08:55.243 --> 08:56.494
And I will help him do that.

08:56.577 --> 08:59.830
Once Jinyowon becomes his,
I'll assume he'll immediately take it out.

08:59.914 --> 09:03.251
His organization will start
their preparations for its release soon.

09:04.710 --> 09:07.463
Bu-yeon, right now,
is staying in Jinyowon, isn't she?

09:08.256 --> 09:10.591
Does she also know that…
that you're staying here?

09:11.342 --> 09:12.510
I didn't tell her. No.

09:13.094 --> 09:13.970
[Jin] So I see.

09:14.470 --> 09:16.305
If she finds out
you left for North Fortress

09:16.389 --> 09:19.392
without telling her the truth,
you're really going to hurt her.

09:20.935 --> 09:21.769
Yes.

09:25.356 --> 09:26.190
[Jang Uk sighs]

09:27.483 --> 09:29.110
[Go Won]
Did you really not tell the shaman?

09:29.860 --> 09:30.695
Why?

09:30.778 --> 09:32.947
She's not actually a shaman, Eunuch Go.

09:33.030 --> 09:33.990
You two fighting?

09:35.283 --> 09:36.909
So you couldn't bring yourself
to tell her.

09:36.993 --> 09:38.119
[sighs]

09:38.953 --> 09:39.787
Why?

09:40.288 --> 09:41.122
Why were you arguing?

09:41.205 --> 09:44.166
During my time as a eunuch,

09:44.792 --> 09:47.378
she told me quite a bit
about your relationship.

09:47.461 --> 09:48.379
Tell me what's wrong.

09:49.338 --> 09:50.673
[quirky music playing]

09:50.756 --> 09:53.676
Did she… talk a lot about me?

09:53.759 --> 09:57.013
Almost every single day,
she was heartbroken because of you.

09:57.096 --> 09:59.181
Well, now. That's rich coming from you.

09:59.807 --> 10:01.100
[chuckles]
What?

10:01.601 --> 10:03.352
Did she break your heart this time?

10:03.894 --> 10:05.271
What, did the shaman cheat on you?

10:08.024 --> 10:08.858
Seriously?

10:08.941 --> 10:11.944
I was kidding around,
but did she really fall for someone new?

10:12.028 --> 10:14.030
No, he's not exactly what you'd call new.

10:14.113 --> 10:15.531
An old flame then.

10:15.615 --> 10:17.116
So what? Did she run off to him?

10:17.199 --> 10:18.242
No, she didn't go.

10:19.368 --> 10:21.746
She can't be with him
because he doesn't recognize her.

10:23.414 --> 10:24.373
Wow.

10:25.458 --> 10:26.709
So that can only mean…

10:28.294 --> 10:29.754
- he's a married man.
- Married?

10:29.837 --> 10:31.172
[quirky music continues playing]

10:31.255 --> 10:32.089
A married man?

10:32.173 --> 10:33.549
It only makes sense if he's married.

10:33.633 --> 10:35.593
And that's why he pretends
he doesn't know her.

10:36.844 --> 10:38.012
Uh, damn!

10:38.095 --> 10:41.265
Seeing how he has yet to give into
her request, he must be a good man.

10:41.349 --> 10:42.975
Maybe she is the dangerous one.

10:43.601 --> 10:44.644
She's ready to abandon you

10:44.727 --> 10:46.437
and chase after him
like a moth to a flame.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.647
Don't call her a moth!

10:48.689 --> 10:50.399
And she hasn't abandoned me just yet.

10:50.483 --> 10:51.359
[Go Won] Not yet?

10:51.442 --> 10:53.944
Does that mean you're expecting her
to abandon you relatively soon?

10:54.028 --> 10:55.613
[groans]
You can't be serious.

10:56.781 --> 10:59.033
This truly isn't something
I should be joking about.

10:59.116 --> 11:00.660
Exactly. So could you please just stop…

11:01.202 --> 11:02.953
confusing me by saying
he's probably married?

11:03.537 --> 11:06.290
Or that… she's nothing more than a moth.

11:06.374 --> 11:09.835
How can you have the ice stone
in your heart and have reached Hwansu,

11:09.919 --> 11:11.796
but are unable to win your wife's heart?

11:12.713 --> 11:14.548
That power of yours is truly useless.

11:15.466 --> 11:16.384
[Go Won tuts]

11:19.804 --> 11:22.848
[Go Won] Even if you feel frustrated,
you can't even see her in this situation.

11:22.932 --> 11:26.143
I'll meet with her and I'll ask her
what's going on with her myself.

11:26.227 --> 11:27.144
Just stay in here.

11:32.983 --> 11:34.276
A married man?

11:35.903 --> 11:37.154
[sighs]
Damn!

11:42.576 --> 11:44.870
[Go Won] There is no way
I can ask her what's going on

11:44.954 --> 11:46.205
in the present situation.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.543
If I were to step in
and stop Jin Mu right now,

11:51.377 --> 11:53.003
our entire plan will fall apart.

11:55.256 --> 11:57.258
[Jin Mu]
Perfect opportunity to attack Jinyowon

11:57.341 --> 11:58.467
has been gifted to us.

11:58.551 --> 12:01.929
They have no plaque
and their heir is trapped in Gwido.

12:02.012 --> 12:05.641
Right now, Jin Ho-gyeong is so weak
that she can't do anything to rescue her.

12:05.724 --> 12:07.268
Then will you make your move soon?

12:09.019 --> 12:12.398
I promised I'd invite you
to our organization, did I not?

12:12.982 --> 12:14.358
We will all gather tonight

12:15.192 --> 12:16.944
and open the door of Jinyowon.

12:17.027 --> 12:19.071
[suspenseful music intensifies]

12:20.573 --> 12:21.407
Tonight then.

12:22.283 --> 12:25.661
[Jang Uk] They're moving tonight?
Our chance is here sooner than expected.

12:25.744 --> 12:27.121
Please inform Songrim as well.

12:27.204 --> 12:29.123
Hold on! There's one problem.

12:30.249 --> 12:32.418
Bu-yeon is currently locked up
in Cheonbugwan's prison.

12:34.628 --> 12:35.713
In what prison?

12:35.796 --> 12:39.758
[Go Won] Gwido, the prison that contains
all those convicted of performing sorcery.

12:39.842 --> 12:41.385
Bu-yeon is trapped in there now.

12:41.469 --> 12:43.804
[tense music playing]

12:45.639 --> 12:48.100
If you ask me
to open Gwido's door to save her,

12:48.184 --> 12:49.226
I will do so at once.

12:49.310 --> 12:50.144
However,

12:50.811 --> 12:52.354
if I show my hand
and side with Jinyowon now,

12:52.438 --> 12:54.732
the secret organization
won't gather tonight,

12:54.815 --> 12:56.692
and Jin Mu will no longer trust me.

12:57.985 --> 13:00.696
What will you do?
I will follow whatever you decide.

13:04.867 --> 13:06.869
[tense music playing]

13:19.131 --> 13:20.925
[tense music continues playing]

13:21.008 --> 13:21.842
[wraith growls]

13:23.552 --> 13:24.386
[wraith growls]

13:28.307 --> 13:30.267
I must go inside Gwido.

13:30.351 --> 13:31.435
Please continue

13:31.519 --> 13:33.270
as if you don't know anything,
Your Royal Highness.

13:44.949 --> 13:46.742
Jang Uk. It's a turtle.

13:49.745 --> 13:50.871
It's my turtle!

13:51.455 --> 13:52.373
It's strange because…

13:52.456 --> 13:54.500
Jin Bu-yeon took that turtle
into Gwido with her.

13:55.084 --> 13:57.294
[Go Won] Hey, turtle.
How did you get out of there?

13:58.003 --> 14:00.464
[mysterious music playing]

14:08.013 --> 14:09.890
[Go Won] Jang Uk, come out here.

14:12.893 --> 14:14.562
This is the door to get into Gwido.

14:14.645 --> 14:16.105
How did it get all the way over here?

14:17.189 --> 14:18.148
Did you come out of there?

14:19.858 --> 14:22.861
[Jang Uk] Someone opened
the door into Gwido here.

14:23.571 --> 14:26.532
They must have made the door
because they want us to go in.

14:27.741 --> 14:28.701
They who?

14:29.618 --> 14:31.704
Hey, turtle, did you do this?

14:32.288 --> 14:33.789
Since they tried to summon us…

14:36.417 --> 14:37.960
it must be whoever's in there.

14:41.297 --> 14:44.133
[Bu-yeon] She must have summoned Uk
using Jin Bu-yeon's divine powers.

14:45.718 --> 14:49.471
She must have opened the door
to protect her body.

14:49.555 --> 14:50.973
Was it something you did?

14:51.557 --> 14:54.018
You are correct. Jin Bu-yeon opened it.

14:54.101 --> 14:55.853
[Go Won]
Your divine powers are incredible.

14:55.936 --> 14:58.480
With such powers,
couldn't you just cast it away?

14:58.564 --> 15:00.274
Why go through the trouble
of summoning Jang Uk?

15:01.901 --> 15:02.735
You are right.

15:02.818 --> 15:06.405
It was a waste of my powers
and it made him see something that I…

15:09.408 --> 15:10.409
didn't want him to.

15:10.492 --> 15:12.745
[melancholy music playing]

15:22.755 --> 15:24.840
The ice stone that is in Jang Uk's body…

15:25.341 --> 15:27.468
is the one
that Master Seo Gyeong left behind

15:27.551 --> 15:28.844
to save Jin Seol-ran.

15:28.928 --> 15:30.888
But Jin Seol-ran is supposed to be dead.

15:31.597 --> 15:34.516
So why do you think he decided
to leave the ice stone in Jinyowon

15:35.100 --> 15:36.518
instead of just destroying it?

15:37.394 --> 15:39.104
What exactly
are you trying to accuse me of?

15:40.773 --> 15:42.524
You used the ice stone

15:42.608 --> 15:45.527
to save your unborn baby
that had died inside your womb.

15:46.278 --> 15:48.572
And that baby was Jin Bu-yeon.

15:50.115 --> 15:52.660
If Jin Seol-ran's soul remained
in that ice stone,

15:52.743 --> 15:54.495
I wondered if that baby you saved

15:54.578 --> 15:57.998
might have been the soul
of Jin Seol-ran all this time after all.

16:00.584 --> 16:02.878
Jin Seol-ran, like you daughter,
was born blind

16:02.962 --> 16:05.130
and even possessed
astounding divine powers.

16:05.214 --> 16:06.465
Have you never found this…

16:06.548 --> 16:07.841
[tense music playing]

16:07.925 --> 16:09.301
to be a little peculiar?

16:10.678 --> 16:13.222
What does that matter
when I gave birth to her and raised her?

16:13.305 --> 16:16.100
[tense music continues playing]

16:16.183 --> 16:20.396
Regardless, if Bu-yeon possesses
such extraordinary powers,

16:20.479 --> 16:23.315
then she will safely escape from Gwido.

16:24.024 --> 16:26.360
Perhaps Naksu went into that prison

16:26.443 --> 16:29.154
with the intention
to retrieve Bu-yeon's divine powers.

16:31.031 --> 16:32.449
Maybe she made…
[inhales sharply]

16:33.117 --> 16:35.285
…the decision
to disappear in there for good?

16:37.788 --> 16:39.790
[suspenseful music playing]

16:51.927 --> 16:54.221
I looked around and found no threats.

16:55.180 --> 16:57.307
That said, this place is massive.

16:57.850 --> 16:59.768
Do you think you can find
the plaque all on your own?

17:01.270 --> 17:03.981
If this body's power is
as great as Jin Seol-ran's, yes.

17:06.316 --> 17:09.194
I saw that Jang Uk tried to find you
with his red jade.

17:11.113 --> 17:12.656
So I'm assuming you must have a blue jade.

17:19.830 --> 17:21.331
Did Jang Uk try to call me with this?

17:23.083 --> 17:24.168
I had no idea.

17:25.127 --> 17:27.087
Was he the one who gave it to you?

17:29.548 --> 17:30.799
Actually, that's not yours.

17:31.884 --> 17:33.052
That belongs to someone else.

17:35.137 --> 17:35.971
I know that.

17:37.222 --> 17:38.932
He loaned it to me temporarily…

17:40.726 --> 17:42.102
so that I could see her memories.

17:43.687 --> 17:45.022
You can do something like that?

17:45.606 --> 17:47.691
You really are
a powerful priestess then, aren't you?

17:49.193 --> 17:51.153
[inhales deeply]
Give it to me.

17:52.362 --> 17:54.198
I'll return it to Jang Uk
since it's not yours.

17:56.158 --> 17:56.992
[soft chuckle]

17:59.661 --> 18:00.662
Didn't you try to…

18:02.581 --> 18:03.957
take this jade in the past as well?

18:06.251 --> 18:07.086
I returned it.

18:07.169 --> 18:08.295
Don't lie to me, Your Highness.

18:10.589 --> 18:12.091
You threw it but she still found it.

18:13.217 --> 18:14.384
You know far too much.

18:17.721 --> 18:18.555
[scoffs]

18:19.723 --> 18:20.766
She must…

18:22.392 --> 18:24.269
remember me
as some kind of horrible villain.

18:25.270 --> 18:26.230
She thought…

18:27.648 --> 18:30.651
that it would have been nice
if you worked with Jang Uk as his ally…

18:32.569 --> 18:33.487
and not as his enemy.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.489
[soft music playing]

18:36.073 --> 18:37.741
If she saw you two working together now,

18:39.660 --> 18:40.828
she would have been so happy.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.957
Whenever I'd tell her
any of my petty thoughts,

18:46.375 --> 18:48.043
she would always sympathize with me.

18:49.711 --> 18:50.587
Despite that,

18:50.671 --> 18:54.174
it was annoyingly impressive
to see her always stand by her master.

18:56.635 --> 18:57.761
That's why I liked her.

18:59.346 --> 19:00.806
But the entire time, she was…

19:03.934 --> 19:05.310
deceiving you, Your Highness.

19:07.271 --> 19:08.188
I know.

19:10.816 --> 19:12.776
That's why when she died, I took comfort…

19:13.819 --> 19:16.321
in believing that I would forget about her
because of her betrayal.

19:18.073 --> 19:18.907
However…

19:20.868 --> 19:22.369
I've never really been able to.

19:27.082 --> 19:29.543
I wanted to have the girl that I liked
all for myself.

19:31.086 --> 19:32.880
And when I decided to turn on Jang Uk…

19:35.048 --> 19:36.341
my shameful desire

19:36.884 --> 19:39.887
to destroy something that I could not have
definitely played a part.

19:41.263 --> 19:42.931
This is why whenever I think of her,

19:43.557 --> 19:46.935
I feel ashamed of myself,
and filled with this painful remorse.

19:47.644 --> 19:49.563
If she knew the pain
that you're going through right now…

19:53.025 --> 19:54.234
she would probably be…

19:55.319 --> 19:56.445
more than happy with that.

19:57.738 --> 19:58.697
Yeah.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.366
She was not the kind of person

20:01.450 --> 20:02.868
who would tell me
to just get over my pain.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.372
If it's possible,
I'd like her to know that I'm in…

20:09.333 --> 20:10.751
an unbearable amount of pain.

20:12.878 --> 20:14.379
And it's never stopped since she died.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.050
She still…

20:20.594 --> 20:22.304
wouldn't wish for the pain
to last forever.

20:25.474 --> 20:26.767
Just suffer for some time…

20:29.978 --> 20:30.812
and then move on.

20:30.896 --> 20:32.898
[pensive music playing]

20:37.653 --> 20:38.695
[soft chuckle]

20:46.870 --> 20:49.414
I found this
among So-i's belongings at her funeral.

20:50.874 --> 20:53.043
The potion looked strange,
so I brought it for you.

20:53.627 --> 20:56.505
This is a soul potion used for sorcery.

20:56.588 --> 20:59.299
This is a heinous potion
that narrows one's mind,

20:59.383 --> 21:01.677
making them
highly susceptible to divination.

21:02.386 --> 21:03.512
Master Heo.

21:03.595 --> 21:07.266
Is that… the type of potion
that was being used on the Queen

21:07.766 --> 21:10.519
while she was being held captive
after they shifted her soul?

21:10.602 --> 21:11.436
That's right.

21:12.020 --> 21:13.981
This was concocted by Shaman Choi.

21:14.773 --> 21:16.566
So how did So-i come to possess
such a thing?

21:17.150 --> 21:18.068
So-i was…

21:19.152 --> 21:21.238
being manipulated
by the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

21:23.907 --> 21:26.535
Maybe the potion came from there.
I'll take a look into it.

21:30.539 --> 21:32.332
It must be that potion.

21:32.416 --> 21:35.669
Madam So-i and that mage from Cheonbugwan

21:35.752 --> 21:38.547
would feed it to the others
about once or twice a month.

21:39.131 --> 21:40.799
She, uh, called it the bell potion.

21:41.508 --> 21:42.342
Bell potion?

21:42.926 --> 21:45.137
She said if you consume it,
you would hear bells ringing

21:45.637 --> 21:46.763
before going insane.

21:50.267 --> 21:52.227
Do you know exactly who she'd used it on?

21:52.311 --> 21:53.520
[sucks teeth]
No, I don't.

21:53.603 --> 21:55.439
She rarely told me
anything about Cheonbugwan

21:55.522 --> 21:56.440
since it was too dangerous.

21:58.442 --> 22:02.070
Ah, there was one time
she mentioned someone who took it.

22:09.328 --> 22:13.040
I've rarely felt guilty
about any of the actions

22:13.123 --> 22:16.793
I have taken in my life so far,
except for one.

22:17.836 --> 22:19.671
One person I feel bad for.

22:19.755 --> 22:21.465
- [somber music playing]
- [inhales deeply]

22:21.548 --> 22:23.133
That person was kind…

22:24.343 --> 22:26.219
and had always treated me well.

22:26.303 --> 22:28.096
Ah, was it some guy?

22:28.180 --> 22:29.264
Not that.

22:29.848 --> 22:32.017
A girl from Sari Village from back when…

22:33.727 --> 22:34.728
[So-i inhales deeply]

22:34.811 --> 22:37.314
Had I not stolen something
that was rightfully hers,

22:37.397 --> 22:39.775
she would have found
her parents so much sooner.

22:41.943 --> 22:44.696
And perhaps, she might not have gone crazy
and died like that.

22:44.780 --> 22:45.864
She went crazy?

22:45.947 --> 22:48.366
She was also a victim of the bell potion.

22:50.327 --> 22:52.037
So a girl she met in Sari Village…

22:52.120 --> 22:53.663
[suspenseful music intensifies]

22:53.747 --> 22:55.499
was someone
who had consumed this bell potion?

22:56.291 --> 22:57.292
Yeah.

23:00.796 --> 23:04.174
[Queen] Just like your father,
you never once cared to visit your aunt.

23:04.257 --> 23:07.219
And now you come here
asking about that soul potion.

23:07.302 --> 23:10.347
I heard you were force-fed the potion
when you were held captive.

23:10.430 --> 23:11.515
Did you ever hear

23:12.182 --> 23:13.934
the sound of bells ringing back then?

23:14.017 --> 23:15.560
[tense music playing]

23:15.644 --> 23:18.146
- [bells ringing]
- [choking]

23:18.230 --> 23:19.731
[chokes]

23:19.815 --> 23:20.774
[breathes roughly]

23:22.109 --> 23:24.653
I don't want to relive that time. Enough!

23:24.736 --> 23:25.695
This is important, Your Highness.

23:26.279 --> 23:30.075
Someone still seems to be controlling
soul shifters by using this potion.

23:30.158 --> 23:31.952
Shaman Choi, her brother, and Jang Gang

23:32.035 --> 23:34.246
are why Her Highness is now
a soul shifter.

23:34.329 --> 23:35.205
Since they're all dead,

23:35.288 --> 23:36.748
please don't trouble Her Highness
with this.

23:37.707 --> 23:40.168
Your Highness, your memory
may have been altered by the potion.

23:40.252 --> 23:41.753
Please, try to remember.

23:41.837 --> 23:43.130
I know it may be painful,

23:43.922 --> 23:45.298
but try to recall
anything from that time--

23:45.382 --> 23:46.633
Ugh! I said enough!

23:46.716 --> 23:48.802
My time there still brings me pain.

23:48.885 --> 23:52.139
How dare you ask me
when you can't do anything for my agony?

23:52.222 --> 23:53.932
This is to put an end
to the alchemy of souls,

23:54.015 --> 23:55.642
which is the true cause of all your pain.

23:55.725 --> 23:57.310
Why would I put an end to it at all?

23:57.894 --> 23:59.813
[Queen]
I don't understand why it's forbidden.

24:00.397 --> 24:04.234
I, the Queen, just want to take
a young, insignificant body.

24:04.776 --> 24:05.694
Is that wrong?

24:06.820 --> 24:09.239
[tense music playing]

24:09.781 --> 24:11.616
Didn't you yourself almost die?

24:11.700 --> 24:13.702
If the alchemy of souls is permitted,

24:13.785 --> 24:16.121
the Seo family's precious son
will never die.

24:16.204 --> 24:19.958
And you could remain forever
as the all-powerful leader of Songrim.

24:20.667 --> 24:22.210
Who wouldn't want that?

24:22.294 --> 24:23.587
If one with power…

24:24.796 --> 24:27.424
also had everything they desired
and could never die,

24:28.425 --> 24:29.968
what do you think
will become of this world?

24:31.094 --> 24:33.680
Just as rain should not pour
without an end in sight,

24:33.763 --> 24:36.433
and as the sun should not stay up,
scorching down upon the earth,

24:36.516 --> 24:37.851
no one should be that…

24:39.186 --> 24:43.023
powerful all while they attempt
to escape death and live forever.

24:43.857 --> 24:46.443
[cackles]

24:47.652 --> 24:50.947
We are all so tired of your hypocrisy.

24:51.031 --> 24:53.867
How do you think the powerful would act?

24:54.701 --> 24:58.288
What they truly want is to join hands
with the very people

24:58.371 --> 24:59.748
who will grant them strength.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.917
And the one offering such things…

25:02.792 --> 25:03.627
is Jin Mu?

25:03.710 --> 25:05.503
- What did--
- Please calm down, Your Highness.

25:05.587 --> 25:08.673
Her Highness is in extreme distress.
You should all leave now.

25:08.757 --> 25:10.759
[tense music continues playing]

25:13.303 --> 25:16.473
Jin Mu was controlling
soul shifters with his potion.

25:16.556 --> 25:17.807
Perhaps Naksu…

25:19.643 --> 25:21.478
was also being controlled by him.

25:22.562 --> 25:24.439
Even so, that doesn't change the fact

25:24.522 --> 25:26.775
that Naksu had used
the alchemy of souls on herself.

25:26.858 --> 25:30.320
Still, I'd like to tell the truth.
That way, I can lessen her burden

25:30.403 --> 25:32.906
of being responsible
for what happened three years ago.

25:33.698 --> 25:36.117
Uk is also in pain
since he's paying the price for…

25:36.868 --> 25:38.036
everything she did.

25:38.119 --> 25:39.579
Do you think he's in pain

25:40.705 --> 25:42.540
only because he feels
that he is responsible

25:42.624 --> 25:44.167
for everything that Naksu did?

25:45.085 --> 25:46.670
You remember what the Queen said?

25:46.753 --> 25:48.255
She said that she saw no fault

25:48.338 --> 25:51.007
with the already powerful
acquiring everlasting power.

25:52.884 --> 25:55.011
Uk already possesses
that kind of power now.

25:55.679 --> 26:00.100
What torments him is the responsibility
that he has as the one who possesses it.

26:01.059 --> 26:04.354
The power that those like Jin Mu
and the Queen desire to get a hold of.

26:05.105 --> 26:07.565
Because depending on the path
that Uk decided to take…

26:09.442 --> 26:12.362
he may do just as Jin Mu wishes
and dry out this world, or…

26:13.989 --> 26:15.532
he could stop it from happening.

26:17.659 --> 26:18.910
[sighs]

26:18.994 --> 26:20.829
[pensive music playing]

26:20.912 --> 26:22.914
Deciding who he wishes to target and…

26:23.540 --> 26:25.333
which path he should take too…

26:26.459 --> 26:28.712
will always be a painful burden for him.

26:29.379 --> 26:32.757
Perhaps a burden
more than any human could handle.

26:41.850 --> 26:43.310
[Master Lee]
I'm the one who saved her life

26:43.977 --> 26:44.936
and took care of her.

26:45.812 --> 26:48.356
But you, of all people,
completely took the one thing

26:48.982 --> 26:50.859
she had tried so desperately to hide.

26:52.444 --> 26:53.445
[Jang Uk] It's not possible

26:54.279 --> 26:56.906
that Master Lee was unaware
there was another soul in that body.

26:58.199 --> 26:59.284
He knew who it was

27:00.368 --> 27:01.619
and feigned ignorance like before.

27:01.703 --> 27:04.039
[suspenseful music playing]

27:07.834 --> 27:09.294
That same mark.

27:09.377 --> 27:12.922
There was a huge tree
back where I used to live.

27:13.006 --> 27:16.760
I often imagined myself
standing alone on top of a very tall tree.

27:17.344 --> 27:18.845
[Jang Uk] That same memory.

27:18.928 --> 27:21.681
[suspenseful music continues playing]

27:24.225 --> 27:26.227
If you're not going to do anything,
you should just die.

27:26.811 --> 27:28.938
If you're not going to do anything,
you might as well die.

27:31.691 --> 27:33.276
Are they possibly the same person?

27:45.455 --> 27:47.082
This turtle's why we're here.

27:47.665 --> 27:50.126
Maybe it could help you find the plaque.

27:50.210 --> 27:51.169
Keep it with you.

27:51.795 --> 27:55.131
I'll leave here first.
So talk to Uk, then send him over.

27:56.591 --> 27:57.801
If you're fighting, just make up.

27:58.718 --> 27:59.719
Jang Uk will be…

28:01.930 --> 28:03.348
in an important battle today.

28:03.431 --> 28:06.393
I'm sure that Jin Mu will gather
to attack Jinyowon.

28:06.893 --> 28:08.853
And he will annihilate
every soul shifter there.

28:09.437 --> 28:12.482
We don't know how many there may be
or even how strong they are yet.

28:13.441 --> 28:15.610
That said, we must round up
every single one

28:15.693 --> 28:16.820
that's been hiding out there,

28:17.779 --> 28:20.365
and wipe them all out
to end Jin Mu's greed for good.

28:20.448 --> 28:23.660
I know Jang Uk is
the only person that can do that.

28:23.743 --> 28:26.037
You'll have to eradicate them all
to end this.

28:28.331 --> 28:29.916
Every last one of them must be killed.

28:33.086 --> 28:35.046
[tense music playing]

28:37.590 --> 28:39.175
[Bu-yeon]
The Crown Prince has already left.

28:39.259 --> 28:40.552
So now it's just…

28:42.804 --> 28:43.805
the two of us in here.

28:47.559 --> 28:48.393
So…

28:49.018 --> 28:50.353
ask me what you wanted to.

28:50.437 --> 28:51.271
No.

28:53.106 --> 28:53.940
I'm not asking you.

28:54.733 --> 28:58.069
And you better not say another word
until I've had my say.

29:01.906 --> 29:03.825
This battle I'm about to start
when I return…

29:05.034 --> 29:06.619
is clearly the right thing that I must do.

29:07.245 --> 29:09.330
Because it would mean
I'm doing what I can to stop them…

29:10.790 --> 29:12.417
from committing an unforgivable deed.

29:14.419 --> 29:17.797
Some will attempt to sanction this
as being a truly justified action.

29:17.881 --> 29:20.467
And others will come to see this
as another reason to end me.

29:21.384 --> 29:23.720
But I know
this fight is the right thing to do.

29:24.220 --> 29:26.598
That's why I'm confident
in where I point my sword.

29:28.641 --> 29:30.059
That the path I must take is clear.

29:30.852 --> 29:32.228
That's why I must not…

29:33.104 --> 29:34.773
recognize you standing before me now.

29:37.650 --> 29:38.526
Instead…

29:40.987 --> 29:42.030
I'll ask you something else.

29:45.784 --> 29:46.618
Should…

29:48.912 --> 29:50.163
I just not leave here,

29:52.373 --> 29:53.500
do absolutely nothing…

29:57.670 --> 29:58.755
and stay here with you?

30:04.511 --> 30:06.513
[somber music playing]

30:11.893 --> 30:12.852
Should we?

30:15.897 --> 30:17.857
I could probably close the door to Gwido.

30:18.650 --> 30:19.484
Should we just…

30:21.486 --> 30:22.779
stay right in here together?

30:28.952 --> 30:30.411
But the answer is that there's…

30:33.373 --> 30:35.583
only one clearly correct thing you can do.

30:36.876 --> 30:39.045
No matter the reason behind it
or the justification.

30:40.046 --> 30:41.130
No matter how…

30:45.760 --> 30:47.470
deeply the two of us may…

30:50.682 --> 30:51.683
have longed for each other.

30:55.103 --> 30:57.105
[somber music continues playing]

31:07.699 --> 31:11.286
[Jin] Go to Jinyowon and inform them
of the situation. Prepare to defend it.

31:12.120 --> 31:14.289
- Yes.
- Yul and Sang-ho.

31:14.372 --> 31:15.957
Once the gathering begins
in the secret room,

31:16.040 --> 31:17.292
you should go to Cheonbugwan

31:17.834 --> 31:19.919
and stop any officials
from trying to enter.

31:20.003 --> 31:21.129
- Yes.
- Yes.

31:21.921 --> 31:23.047
Once the battle begins,

31:23.131 --> 31:25.884
I will go to the palace
and meet with His Majesty.

31:25.967 --> 31:28.720
I thought that Uk went to North Fortress.

31:28.803 --> 31:32.307
But now he and the Crown Prince
are going up against Jin Mu.

31:32.390 --> 31:36.269
He has decided to shoulder
a great responsibility.

31:38.187 --> 31:39.272
Please keep him safe.

31:40.523 --> 31:41.649
And please be careful.

31:44.777 --> 31:45.945
Once the sun sets,

31:46.029 --> 31:47.572
Jin Mu's organization
will start to gather.

31:48.156 --> 31:50.074
If we can safely get through this night,

31:50.158 --> 31:54.621
the world that they've been hoping for
will never get the chance to exist.

32:01.586 --> 32:03.087
[dramatic music playing]

32:03.171 --> 32:06.925
[Jin Mu] Once more,
the skies from 200 years ago will open.

32:07.967 --> 32:09.469
When the world dries up,

32:09.552 --> 32:11.679
we will offer up the rite to the skies.

32:12.305 --> 32:14.557
The ice stone,
bearing the energy of the sky,

32:14.641 --> 32:17.060
will finally be in our hands.

32:17.769 --> 32:20.772
It will be a world
where the strong gain greater power,

32:22.565 --> 32:25.818
and we'll continue
to hold that power forever!

32:25.902 --> 32:28.446
[all applauding]

32:32.617 --> 32:34.869
Are you all soul shifters here, right?

32:34.953 --> 32:37.246
Those who wanted youth
gain younger bodies.

32:37.330 --> 32:40.166
Those who wanted power
gain bodies of the powerful.

32:40.249 --> 32:42.126
And those who wanted beauty

32:42.210 --> 32:44.462
gain the most beautiful
and desirable bodies.

32:44.545 --> 32:45.964
Gwanju, I see now.

32:47.715 --> 32:49.467
This is why you should make sure, right?

32:49.968 --> 32:51.970
Right now, they may all be in hiding.

32:53.846 --> 32:56.057
But once we walk in the new world,

32:56.140 --> 32:59.477
they will all be of great help
to Your Royal Highness.

32:59.560 --> 33:00.395
Gwanju.

33:03.147 --> 33:05.149
What will become of those people…

33:08.194 --> 33:10.029
who've had their bodies taken from them?

33:11.030 --> 33:12.490
The young will become old,

33:12.573 --> 33:14.575
the powerful will be forced
out of their positions,

33:14.659 --> 33:16.369
and the beautiful will become ugly.

33:16.869 --> 33:17.745
Sire.

33:18.955 --> 33:20.873
Did I not tell you
that you shouldn't cling

33:20.957 --> 33:23.710
to such insignificant things?

33:23.793 --> 33:25.044
[scoffs]

33:26.879 --> 33:28.673
I don't think
trying to protect things like that

33:28.756 --> 33:29.882
is a sign of weakness.

33:29.966 --> 33:32.010
[tense music playing]

33:32.093 --> 33:33.678
Rather, it's a sign of strength.

33:34.345 --> 33:38.599
And I intend to show you
how powerful that strength can be.

33:39.892 --> 33:42.020
[tense music intensifies]

33:43.021 --> 33:45.023
[epic music playing]

34:16.471 --> 34:18.264
You have been deceiving me.

34:18.347 --> 34:21.517
No, I've never deceived you.
You're the one who underestimated me.

34:21.601 --> 34:24.062
How dare you abandon me like this after I…

34:25.396 --> 34:28.524
have done everything for you?

34:28.608 --> 34:32.111
You can't say you're abandoning someone
when you've never stood with them.

34:34.030 --> 34:36.866
Along with Jang Uk,
I have come to fight against you!

34:36.949 --> 34:38.951
[tense music playing]

34:43.664 --> 34:44.582
Jang Uk?

35:04.685 --> 35:05.520
[mage] Attack!

35:05.603 --> 35:07.563
[all shout]

35:07.647 --> 35:10.191
[intense music playing]

35:14.862 --> 35:16.697
[mages groaning]

35:24.455 --> 35:26.999
- [mage 1 grunts]
- [mage 2 groans]

35:47.145 --> 35:48.771
[Jang Uk] The secret room's barrier.

35:49.689 --> 35:51.691
[suspenseful music playing]

35:54.026 --> 35:55.361
[loud rumbling]

36:00.408 --> 36:02.577
[all exclaiming, grunt]

36:03.077 --> 36:03.911
[Jin Mu] Jang Uk…

36:04.704 --> 36:05.788
is here.

36:05.872 --> 36:07.623
[loud rumbling]

36:10.293 --> 36:11.878
[all exclaim]

36:30.855 --> 36:32.857
[loud thudding]

36:46.329 --> 36:48.331
[intense music playing]

37:08.392 --> 37:10.645
[footsteps slowly approaching]

37:17.777 --> 37:19.237
There's no need to be startled.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.947
All I've done is created a barrier.

37:21.739 --> 37:23.866
However, this one is
much more advance and complex

37:23.950 --> 37:25.326
than the one you used to trap me.

37:26.452 --> 37:27.286
[gasps]

37:29.497 --> 37:30.539
Although, it's been quite busy

37:30.623 --> 37:34.252
as I'm fighting all 78 soul shifters
at this very moment.

37:36.420 --> 37:38.422
[tense music playing]

37:53.229 --> 37:54.146
[soul shifter 1 shouts]

37:59.402 --> 38:00.319
[soul shifter 2 grunts]

38:03.030 --> 38:04.657
[soul shifters groaning]

38:09.245 --> 38:10.788
[soul shifters grunt]

38:18.796 --> 38:20.006
Funny enough,

38:20.089 --> 38:22.341
you're the only non-soul shifter
in this organization.

38:23.050 --> 38:24.468
Perhaps you feared you'd run wild?

38:24.552 --> 38:28.180
Then why would you encourage others
to do something so deadly?

38:29.932 --> 38:32.184
So you have finally come
to take your revenge on me.

38:32.268 --> 38:34.103
I wouldn't be here
for something so meaningless.

38:36.272 --> 38:38.941
I just left a world
that I have always been longing for.

38:39.859 --> 38:43.237
Do you really… think I did that
just to kill you?

38:44.947 --> 38:47.325
I've come all this way
to do what I must because…

38:48.159 --> 38:50.077
what you're doing is unquestionably wrong.

38:51.579 --> 38:53.289
And I'm only doing this to stop you.

38:53.372 --> 38:55.666
[tense music playing]

38:57.084 --> 38:58.919
It's true that I vehemently resent you.

38:59.920 --> 39:01.630
But that revenge isn't mine to take.

39:03.632 --> 39:04.467
Go.

39:05.593 --> 39:07.595
[suspenseful music playing]

39:08.929 --> 39:09.764
[scoffs]

39:20.566 --> 39:21.400
[sighs]

39:28.532 --> 39:29.950
Go and do what you must do.

39:30.034 --> 39:31.118
I'll stay here…

39:33.496 --> 39:34.705
and also do what I must.

39:36.290 --> 39:37.666
Now send Jin Mu here to me.

39:39.377 --> 39:40.419
[grunts]

39:44.799 --> 39:45.883
Why did I end up here?

39:52.139 --> 39:53.182
The ice stone?

39:53.265 --> 39:54.892
[dramatic music playing]

40:15.788 --> 40:17.665
It was definitely an ice stone.

40:18.916 --> 40:21.168
Has it been one here this entire time?

40:33.139 --> 40:35.141
[suspenseful music playing]

41:00.207 --> 41:02.042
As I thought, it was here.

41:10.009 --> 41:11.093
[Bu-yeon] That is an ice stone.

41:14.638 --> 41:15.723
[Jin Mu] That's right.

41:16.682 --> 41:18.309
I forgot that you were in here.

41:18.893 --> 41:20.102
Jin Bu-yeon, were you…

41:21.353 --> 41:22.855
the one who found this ice stone?

41:23.731 --> 41:26.984
Yes, I found one as I had
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

41:28.527 --> 41:30.154
I thought you had no memories.

41:31.739 --> 41:34.450
Regardless, I'm impressed
that you found it again,

41:34.533 --> 41:35.826
just like you did back then.

41:35.910 --> 41:37.036
It's yours.

41:38.287 --> 41:39.121
I'll give it to you.

41:39.205 --> 41:41.207
The ice stone possesses
the energy of the sky,

41:41.916 --> 41:44.376
so those who haven't been chosen
can't have it.

41:44.460 --> 41:47.671
Both Jang Gang and Shaman Choi
have wielded its power.

41:47.755 --> 41:51.509
But neither were able to possess it
as their own the way Jang Uk has.

41:51.592 --> 41:53.093
Would you like me to help out?

41:54.678 --> 41:55.513
Can you?

41:56.764 --> 41:57.640
[soft chuckle]

42:01.101 --> 42:01.936
That's right.

42:04.772 --> 42:09.151
You are a priestess that is second only
to Seo Gyeong's love, Jin Seol-ran.

42:11.737 --> 42:12.571
Go on.

42:13.948 --> 42:14.782
Try.

42:15.533 --> 42:16.367
I'll…

42:17.660 --> 42:19.411
make that ice stone all your own.

42:21.288 --> 42:23.457
[ominous music playing]

42:55.030 --> 42:56.615
What is happening to me?

42:57.783 --> 42:58.617
My energy…

42:58.701 --> 43:00.661
That ice stone has nothing inside it.

43:03.497 --> 43:05.332
Just like a soul shifter that's run wild…

43:06.959 --> 43:08.794
it only seeks to consume energy.

43:10.671 --> 43:12.631
[groans]

43:16.802 --> 43:18.220
Your death will not be quick.

43:18.304 --> 43:20.389
You will slowly wither away…

43:21.348 --> 43:22.474
like a piece of wood.

43:23.058 --> 43:24.351
[breathes shakily]

43:24.435 --> 43:25.978
[dramatic music playing]

43:26.061 --> 43:27.688
Just like that Choi family mage.

43:28.522 --> 43:29.523
[in strained voice]
Why…

43:32.234 --> 43:33.235
[shouts]
would you do this?

43:33.319 --> 43:35.362
Surely, you couldn't have forgotten
my face.

43:38.198 --> 43:40.200
I suppose you couldn't imagine
it could really be me.

43:41.952 --> 43:42.828
Danju.

43:44.330 --> 43:46.332
[tense music playing]

43:47.750 --> 43:50.085
Nak-su?

43:52.171 --> 43:54.256
They say this is a prison for sorcerers.

43:55.716 --> 43:56.550
[grunts]

44:00.179 --> 44:03.515
This is the kind of death
that's perfectly suited for you.

44:04.892 --> 44:06.352
Try not to hold it against me.

44:09.063 --> 44:10.272
Because I too…

44:13.317 --> 44:15.069
will likely disappear in this place.

44:16.236 --> 44:17.655
[groans in pain]

44:25.329 --> 44:26.372
[Jin Mu groaning]

44:42.721 --> 44:43.722
[Go Won] Jang Uk.

44:45.766 --> 44:47.393
You've finally put an end to all this.

44:49.603 --> 44:51.063
[Seo Yul] Uk, are you all right?

44:53.232 --> 44:54.733
Your body is as cold as ice.

44:55.359 --> 44:56.193
For now, I…

44:57.403 --> 44:58.237
I can handle it.

44:58.821 --> 44:59.863
Where's Jin Mu right now?

45:00.781 --> 45:01.824
I sent Jin Mu to Gwido.

45:02.658 --> 45:06.036
There, he will die a death
that is most appropriate for his crimes.

45:06.954 --> 45:08.455
But Jin Bu-yeon is still in Gwido.

45:09.289 --> 45:10.874
[Jang Uk]
She's who asked me to send him there.

45:12.042 --> 45:15.129
So that she'll be able to…
fulfill her role.

45:21.051 --> 45:22.386
[exhales heavily]

45:23.470 --> 45:24.513
Uk.

45:25.139 --> 45:28.016
[breathes shakily]

45:36.942 --> 45:39.945
[Jin] Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan has been sent
to Gwido, the prison for sorcerers.

45:40.028 --> 45:43.490
And all of his soul shifters
have been turned to stone.

45:43.574 --> 45:45.826
This was orchestrated
by Jang Uk and Songrim?

45:45.909 --> 45:47.077
Without telling anyone?

45:47.161 --> 45:49.204
Today seemed like
our only chance to strike,

45:49.955 --> 45:53.167
so there was no time to discuss
with you or the Assembly.

45:53.250 --> 45:56.170
Even so,
Jang Uk's power is truly incredible.

45:56.753 --> 45:58.464
And Songrim controls that power.

45:58.547 --> 46:01.008
Now that your only rival, Jin Mu, is gone…

46:02.134 --> 46:05.512
I suppose Songrim had no reason
to consider anything else.

46:07.473 --> 46:09.683
This battle was not in hopes
of seizing more power.

46:10.476 --> 46:12.728
We only did it to stop Jin Mu's…

46:12.811 --> 46:15.147
dangerous scheme to remove
the fire bird from Jinyowon.

46:15.230 --> 46:16.231
No matter why,

46:16.982 --> 46:20.527
the fact is that Songrim, now,
has divine power that everyone desired,

46:20.611 --> 46:22.070
but was not allowed to possess.

46:23.989 --> 46:25.741
Not everyone will be thrilled.

46:26.658 --> 46:28.660
[tense music playing]

46:32.080 --> 46:34.291
Jin Mu is dead?
[breathes shakily]

46:34.374 --> 46:36.793
But… what will become of me now?

46:36.877 --> 46:38.170
[in shaky voice]
Does that mean…

46:40.380 --> 46:43.091
I will never be able to escape this body?

46:45.093 --> 46:46.512
He's trapped in Gwido.

46:47.095 --> 46:48.680
I don't think he'll survive in there.

46:48.764 --> 46:50.432
[screams]

46:53.435 --> 46:55.020
[screams, pants]

46:56.355 --> 46:57.689
Go find a way in there.

46:57.773 --> 47:00.025
[shouts]
Find me a way in there now!

47:00.108 --> 47:01.818
[groans loudly]

47:05.030 --> 47:06.782
[Queen crying]

47:13.372 --> 47:15.123
Seeing as how Jin Mu came here…

47:19.002 --> 47:21.463
Jang Uk and your owner
must have been successful.

47:24.883 --> 47:26.218
I'll remain here until…

47:28.428 --> 47:29.596
I disappear, then…

47:32.599 --> 47:34.726
Jin Bu-yeon will be the one
to leave this place.

47:36.979 --> 47:37.896
And then…

47:41.775 --> 47:43.986
I won't have to be Jang Uk's final duty.

47:44.486 --> 47:46.488
[somber music playing]

48:00.919 --> 48:02.504
[Bu-yeon] It swam into the sea.

48:03.797 --> 48:06.341
But then, you're a turtle after all.

48:06.425 --> 48:08.385
It's only natural
that you go into the sea.

48:17.644 --> 48:19.855
[light music playing]

48:36.622 --> 48:37.998
This is the Plaque of Jinyowon.

48:48.133 --> 48:49.760
Did you really find it for me…

48:51.261 --> 48:52.721
because you wanted me to leave?

48:55.849 --> 48:56.683
In any case,

48:57.976 --> 48:58.852
thanks a lot.

49:01.897 --> 49:03.899
[bright music playing]

49:10.322 --> 49:11.365
THE BLACK TORTOISE

49:11.448 --> 49:12.699
[Master Lee] I ran into a sacred animal

49:12.783 --> 49:14.785
that possessed
the energy of the Black Tortoise.

49:14.868 --> 49:16.453
It was very determined to crawl somewhere.

49:17.120 --> 49:18.914
So it must have found a path for someone.

49:23.168 --> 49:26.046
I heard that Jang Uk entered Gwido
in search of Jin Bu-yeon.

49:26.630 --> 49:27.589
As he has returned,

49:27.673 --> 49:30.550
I assume that he must have found
his own path as well.

49:30.634 --> 49:33.720
Now he must endure
the cost of using that power,

49:33.804 --> 49:37.474
even after putting an end
to a difficult battle.

49:38.392 --> 49:40.394
[somber music playing]

49:51.905 --> 49:54.991
[Jin] He's enduring the wraiths
that are drawn by the energy of the sky,

49:55.075 --> 50:00.080
fighting yet another battle
in a cold, dark place, all on his own.

50:04.668 --> 50:06.712
Why do you think
that he was the one chosen

50:07.838 --> 50:09.131
to carry this heavy burden?

50:09.214 --> 50:12.217
Is this the price
of being born of sorcery?

50:12.801 --> 50:15.929
All the while, the most powerful
in this world fought over the ice stone,

50:16.012 --> 50:19.725
that power found its way to Uk,
of all people.

50:21.935 --> 50:22.769
[Master Lee] It seems

50:23.812 --> 50:25.230
as though she was the one behind it all.

50:29.401 --> 50:31.778
Who is she though? Who do you mean?

50:31.862 --> 50:34.656
The one who first received
the ice stone from Master Seo Gyeong.

50:36.241 --> 50:37.909
I think she's remained here

50:37.993 --> 50:40.036
and has been trying
to protect the ice stone.

50:40.620 --> 50:43.457
Are you saying
that Jin Seol-ran is still here?

50:45.417 --> 50:46.877
It is my belief that…

50:47.669 --> 50:50.422
perhaps both Jang Uk and that girl
were in fact…

50:52.090 --> 50:53.341
both chosen by her.

51:01.016 --> 51:03.226
Bu-yeon, are you okay?
[sighs]

51:03.894 --> 51:04.728
[Cho-yeon] I'm sorry.

51:05.437 --> 51:07.773
I should have gone in Gwido
instead of you.

51:07.856 --> 51:09.274
I'm all right.

51:10.817 --> 51:11.860
I managed to find the plaque.

51:15.530 --> 51:17.365
[excited gasp]
You really did it.

51:18.074 --> 51:20.118
You truly are my daughter, Bu-yeon.

51:20.994 --> 51:21.828
I'm so sorry.

51:22.662 --> 51:23.830
[Cho-yeon] Don't be sorry.

51:24.831 --> 51:28.168
Because you found the plaque,
Jinyowon will be safe now.

51:29.961 --> 51:32.547
Today, the Unanimous Assembly
will convene.

51:32.631 --> 51:34.758
[Ho-gyeong] You will need to explain
what happened in Gwido.

51:34.841 --> 51:35.842
Are you…

51:36.968 --> 51:37.969
able to do that?

51:38.053 --> 51:39.012
Yes, I can.

51:39.805 --> 51:42.140
I will attend the Unanimous Assembly.

51:44.851 --> 51:47.395
Seo Yul has been waiting
for you to return.

51:47.938 --> 51:48.897
Go and see him.

51:58.532 --> 51:59.616
We have…

52:03.078 --> 52:05.038
decided to continue in our ignorance.

52:06.790 --> 52:09.501
So please, do the same for me.

52:12.087 --> 52:13.296
I have something to tell you.

52:14.881 --> 52:17.634
Jin Mu was using a potion
to control soul shifters.

52:18.635 --> 52:19.594
It is likely that…

52:21.179 --> 52:23.223
the tragedy which occurred in Songrim…

52:25.141 --> 52:27.769
was not Naksu's doing after all,
but rather Jin Mu's.

52:27.853 --> 52:30.397
[indistinct bells ringing]

52:31.356 --> 52:33.483
[suspenseful music playing]

52:36.653 --> 52:38.321
[bells ringing]

52:43.285 --> 52:44.911
[Bu-yeon] So the bells I heard back then

52:45.620 --> 52:46.580
were because of that.

52:47.330 --> 52:48.248
[gasps]

52:51.251 --> 52:52.586
[breathes shakily]

52:57.465 --> 52:59.801
I wanted to tell you
so that you shouldn't blame yourself…

53:01.678 --> 53:04.014
when you tried to look back
and remember what happened.

53:09.936 --> 53:11.396
This may serve as an excuse…

53:14.733 --> 53:16.484
to stay wherever you would like to.

53:19.446 --> 53:22.490
I was just a soul shifter
who was controlled by her own vengeance.

53:23.491 --> 53:25.243
I was an assassin raised in Danhyanggok

53:25.327 --> 53:27.454
who has only ever had
one purpose in my life.

53:28.038 --> 53:29.873
And I would deserve
to meet that terrible demise.

53:33.084 --> 53:33.960
So that…

53:37.923 --> 53:39.633
still cannot be an excuse for what I did.

53:41.760 --> 53:44.471
[somber music playing]

53:47.474 --> 53:48.475
[sad sigh]

53:55.273 --> 53:57.233
What do you mean
you're really going to North Fortress?

53:57.317 --> 53:58.568
If I choose to remain here,

53:59.152 --> 54:01.237
people will continue to persecute
Lord Park and Songrim

54:01.321 --> 54:02.155
over the ice stone.

54:02.739 --> 54:04.449
I must obey His Majesty's command

54:05.033 --> 54:06.242
for the Prince's sake also.

54:07.494 --> 54:08.578
When do you have to go?

54:08.662 --> 54:10.580
As I'm going there
because I was appointed,

54:10.664 --> 54:11.831
I'll have to leave right away.

54:13.208 --> 54:14.417
So I'm afraid to tell you

54:15.168 --> 54:17.087
that I won't be able
to attend your wedding.

54:17.170 --> 54:18.797
Don't worry about that now.

54:19.631 --> 54:22.592
Who knows when I'll see you
if you live all the way out there?

54:22.676 --> 54:24.928
You and Lord Park can always come
and visit me together.

54:25.011 --> 54:27.764
Then what if I went with you
until you settle--

54:27.847 --> 54:28.682
No way!

54:29.265 --> 54:30.225
You can't.

54:32.227 --> 54:33.061
Don't even suggest that.

54:33.144 --> 54:35.605
He's already very jealous of me
since you said you'd only care for me.

54:36.231 --> 54:37.524
[Maid Kim] It can't be helped though.

54:37.607 --> 54:39.734
You'll always be my number one priority.

54:39.818 --> 54:40.902
I know.

54:41.653 --> 54:44.155
But still, don't let Lord Park know that.

54:45.240 --> 54:46.074
[soft chuckle]

54:47.200 --> 54:48.576
He does sulk easily.

54:48.660 --> 54:49.619
[Jang Uk] Mm.
[chuckles softly]

54:50.412 --> 54:51.413
Maidservant Kim.

54:52.747 --> 54:54.374
I may not be there to see the ceremony,

54:55.166 --> 54:57.127
but you must be as beautiful as possible.

54:58.128 --> 55:01.297
So you must look like
the happiest woman in the world.

55:01.381 --> 55:02.841
[soft music playing]

55:02.924 --> 55:03.758
Fine.

55:05.135 --> 55:07.012
I promise to be the most beautiful,

55:08.555 --> 55:09.848
happiest woman ever.

55:14.811 --> 55:17.355
[soft music continues playing]

55:29.659 --> 55:32.412
[Jin] So Uk was already worrying
about what would happen after it all.

55:32.495 --> 55:36.875
After our wedding is over,
let's join him to North Fortress together.

55:36.958 --> 55:38.585
Are you sure that would be all right?

55:39.252 --> 55:41.337
I am no longer the leader of Songrim.

55:41.421 --> 55:42.756
I'm free to go wherever.

55:43.798 --> 55:46.926
Is that also why you didn't attend
the Unanimous Assembly?

55:47.594 --> 55:49.054
If I remain here any longer,

55:49.679 --> 55:52.766
they'll continue to harass Uk
over the ice stone.

55:52.849 --> 55:54.976
That's exactly the excuse he gave me.

55:55.643 --> 55:56.770
If that's the case,

55:57.353 --> 55:59.397
let's go immediately
right after the wedding.

56:00.231 --> 56:01.316
Promise me we will.

56:03.985 --> 56:06.821
[gentle music playing]

56:06.905 --> 56:08.281
Hey, hold on.

56:08.364 --> 56:10.533
Why are you wearing your ring
on this finger though?

56:11.159 --> 56:12.452
Isn't that the wrong finger?

56:12.535 --> 56:14.120
Too small! Way too small!

56:15.413 --> 56:17.332
If I wear it here,
it will cut my blood off.

56:17.415 --> 56:19.876
Oh! Is that so? So remove it.

56:19.959 --> 56:21.544
I'll get it resized then.

56:21.628 --> 56:23.630
Or even buy a new one for you.

56:25.006 --> 56:26.800
[chuckles]
This is fine.

56:27.801 --> 56:29.677
It's a promise of our everlasting love.

56:30.386 --> 56:31.679
I like it here just fine.

56:31.763 --> 56:33.848
- [inhales deeply]
- [Maid Kim chuckles]

56:34.474 --> 56:36.559
That's right. It's my promise.

56:39.437 --> 56:40.271
[chuckles]

56:41.272 --> 56:44.484
[Seo Yul] Will you be going
to North Fortress alone as planned?

56:44.567 --> 56:45.693
Only if I go far…

56:46.236 --> 56:47.987
will everyone be able to find
peace and quiet.

56:49.197 --> 56:50.031
Uk, I…

56:52.283 --> 56:53.451
I have something to tell you.

56:54.911 --> 56:57.205
But unfortunately, it will bring you
neither peace nor solace.

56:57.288 --> 57:00.125
[somber music playing]

57:00.792 --> 57:02.293
The pain you will feel when you hear it,

57:03.128 --> 57:05.004
and the pain you would feel
if you ignored it…

57:06.881 --> 57:08.758
is only something that you can endure,

57:09.717 --> 57:11.261
and not something that I can decide.

57:12.512 --> 57:13.555
So I'm here to tell you…

57:16.391 --> 57:17.350
[sighs]

57:19.686 --> 57:20.979
…Naksu will disappear soon.

57:23.314 --> 57:27.652
She believes that there's no excuse
that can justify you staying together.

57:29.154 --> 57:30.113
But could that one…

57:31.948 --> 57:33.783
serve as enough of a justification?

57:36.161 --> 57:36.995
Yul.

57:38.496 --> 57:39.497
Do you have any idea…

57:41.124 --> 57:43.376
how I felt
when I decided to leave her in there?

57:45.503 --> 57:46.880
Pretending that I didn't know her?

57:47.881 --> 57:50.508
["Love Letter (With You)"
by BIG Naughty playing]

58:04.189 --> 58:05.398
[Jang Uk] I left because I knew…

58:07.400 --> 58:09.694
that I would have to kill her
if I admitted who she was.

58:20.997 --> 58:22.999
["Love Letter (With You)"
by BIG Naughty continues playing]

58:33.343 --> 58:34.677
Just because she will disappear,

58:35.803 --> 58:37.722
it cannot serve as an excuse
for us to be together.

58:43.895 --> 58:46.981
Rather than just staying together
because my death is inevitable…

58:47.565 --> 58:48.399
It's better…

58:51.736 --> 58:53.321
that we each be tormented.

59:04.791 --> 59:06.793
[ominous music playing]

59:11.172 --> 59:13.258
I, Jin Bu-yeon, from the Jin family,

59:13.341 --> 59:15.510
have received
the Jinyowon Plaque from Gwido

59:15.593 --> 59:18.221
in order to prove my power as a priestess.

59:22.850 --> 59:24.852
[dramatic music playing]

59:26.354 --> 59:28.481
[male mage] She retrieved that from Gwido?

59:32.694 --> 59:34.696
So Jang Uk sent Jin Mu to Gwido.

59:35.363 --> 59:36.406
What happened to him?

59:36.489 --> 59:37.323
[Bu-yeon] I found the ice stone

59:37.407 --> 59:39.492
that belonged to a Choi family mage
a long time ago,

59:40.743 --> 59:41.995
and I placed it inside of him.

59:44.664 --> 59:45.540
Jin Mu…

59:47.500 --> 59:49.168
will eventually wither away and die.

59:49.252 --> 59:51.504
[tense music playing]

59:53.256 --> 59:54.507
[mages murmuring]

01:00:07.562 --> 01:00:09.564
[tense music continues playing]

01:00:14.736 --> 01:00:18.990
Like a soul shifter that's run wild,
this ice stone seeks human energy.

01:00:19.574 --> 01:00:21.200
So you put that inside of Jin Mu.

01:00:21.951 --> 01:00:23.786
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon] Well,
it may have lost the energy of the sky,

01:00:23.870 --> 01:00:25.455
it is still an ice stone.

01:00:25.538 --> 01:00:27.582
And you could put that in him?

01:00:28.333 --> 01:00:30.043
Your powers are quite strong.

01:00:30.752 --> 01:00:32.378
[indistinct murmuring]

01:00:32.462 --> 01:00:34.881
If you could put an ice stone in Jin Mu,

01:00:34.964 --> 01:00:37.717
it means you have the power
to remove it as well.

01:00:39.135 --> 01:00:41.387
The purpose of this Unanimous Assembly

01:00:41.471 --> 01:00:44.390
is to deal with the ice stone
Jang Uk carries.

01:00:44.474 --> 01:00:46.726
Since Jin Bu-yeon has such divine power,

01:00:46.809 --> 01:00:48.603
and if all of us agree to do so,

01:00:48.686 --> 01:00:50.855
Jang Uk's ice stone
will be retrieved from him.

01:00:50.938 --> 01:00:55.485
Wait! If you remove that ice stone
from his body, Jang Uk will die!

01:00:55.568 --> 01:00:57.654
He should have already died
three years ago.

01:00:57.737 --> 01:00:58.613
[mage representative] He's only alive

01:00:58.696 --> 01:01:01.074
thanks to the royal family
and the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:01.157 --> 01:01:02.784
If Uk hadn't stood up to Jin Mu,

01:01:03.326 --> 01:01:05.912
the fire bird would have emerged
and brought chaos into this world.

01:01:05.995 --> 01:01:07.330
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
Songrim shouldn't intervene!

01:01:07.413 --> 01:01:11.042
We are meeting today
because you decided to act on your own

01:01:11.125 --> 01:01:13.628
without getting permission from any of us.

01:01:14.545 --> 01:01:15.546
I, the Prince…

01:01:17.507 --> 01:01:18.633
also took part in their plan.

01:01:18.716 --> 01:01:19.967
Do not interfere.

01:01:21.219 --> 01:01:23.304
You also acted
without your King's consent.

01:01:24.013 --> 01:01:26.307
- [Sun] Don't you see that is a problem?
- Sire…

01:01:27.058 --> 01:01:28.101
[sighs]

01:01:28.768 --> 01:01:29.852
[mage representative]
The Unanimous Assembly

01:01:29.936 --> 01:01:31.562
only permitted Jang Uk

01:01:31.646 --> 01:01:33.981
to keep the ice stone
to get rid of soul shifters.

01:01:34.065 --> 01:01:35.775
With all the soul shifters gone,

01:01:35.858 --> 01:01:38.569
there is no reason
to allow him to keep that power.

01:01:38.653 --> 01:01:41.531
[mages murmuring]

01:01:45.618 --> 01:01:47.453
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:50.289 --> 01:01:52.333
If we all agree to do so,

01:01:52.834 --> 01:01:57.755
Jin Bu-yeon, Jinyowon's heir,
must accept what we decide.

01:01:59.841 --> 01:02:01.676
If that's what the Assembly decides,

01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:04.887
then I have no choice but to abide.

01:02:06.472 --> 01:02:08.516
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:17.191 --> 01:02:19.736
Your Highness.
This is the door that leads to Gwido.

01:02:20.903 --> 01:02:22.280
You can find Jin Mu in there

01:02:22.363 --> 01:02:26.284
and ask him where you can find
the Soul Ejector to shift your soul.

01:02:27.577 --> 01:02:31.122
Yun-o, how did you get
the key to the door of Gwido?

01:02:31.205 --> 01:02:32.373
[inhales deeply]

01:02:32.457 --> 01:02:35.084
I have friends from Cheonbugwan
who helped me locate it.

01:02:35.168 --> 01:02:36.502
Really?

01:02:39.714 --> 01:02:40.590
Let's go in.

01:02:48.973 --> 01:02:49.807
[Dang-gu] Uk.

01:02:51.225 --> 01:02:52.059
Where is Bu-yeon?

01:02:52.143 --> 01:02:56.439
She just left after agreeing to abide
by the Unanimous Assembly's decision.

01:03:01.736 --> 01:03:03.404
[suspenseful music playing]

01:03:10.745 --> 01:03:14.582
The Unanimous Assembly was discussing
what to do with your ice stone.

01:03:14.665 --> 01:03:16.709
Once we make our decision,

01:03:17.210 --> 01:03:21.881
Jin Bu-yeon, the priestess of Jinyowon,
will remove the ice stone from you.

01:03:21.964 --> 01:03:25.593
Did Bu-yeon agree to abide
by your decision?

01:03:25.676 --> 01:03:26.511
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon] She did.

01:03:26.594 --> 01:03:31.682
She exposed all the wrongdoings
that you've been hiding from all of us.

01:03:37.438 --> 01:03:38.397
There remains

01:03:39.524 --> 01:03:41.984
a soul shifter
that Jang Uk decided to spare last night.

01:03:42.652 --> 01:03:44.737
He clearly knew
that they were a soul shifter,

01:03:46.322 --> 01:03:47.865
but he feigned ignorance.

01:03:47.949 --> 01:03:50.034
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
Is Jin Bu-yeon's assertion true?

01:03:51.994 --> 01:03:52.829
Yes.

01:03:53.454 --> 01:03:55.373
I pretended that I didn't know
and spared them.

01:04:00.503 --> 01:04:04.006
Did she say if I should identify
and slay that soul shifter?

01:04:04.090 --> 01:04:07.844
Tell him to stop pretending
he doesn't know.

01:04:10.137 --> 01:04:11.848
He needs to confirm it exists

01:04:13.015 --> 01:04:14.100
and then watch as…

01:04:17.061 --> 01:04:18.312
it withers and dies.

01:04:20.439 --> 01:04:23.192
She gave me a reason
to track down and kill that soul shifter.

01:04:23.276 --> 01:04:24.819
What do you mean "reason"?

01:04:25.486 --> 01:04:28.239
That has been your duty from the start.

01:04:28.823 --> 01:04:29.657
Okay then,

01:04:30.324 --> 01:04:31.951
in order to fulfill my duty,

01:04:32.577 --> 01:04:33.995
I will no longer feign ignorance.

01:04:36.789 --> 01:04:38.541
I'll make sure to confirm it exists

01:04:38.624 --> 01:04:40.793
before I finally watch it wither and die.

01:04:41.586 --> 01:04:42.420
Now…

01:04:43.629 --> 01:04:45.214
I'm going to take my leave.

01:04:46.007 --> 01:04:47.341
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
Where do you think you're going?

01:04:47.425 --> 01:04:49.135
We're here to discuss what you did wrong!

01:04:49.218 --> 01:04:50.845
[shouts]
And now that discussion is over!

01:04:54.974 --> 01:04:57.184
[tense music playing]

01:05:04.525 --> 01:05:06.694
According to the reason
that you have given me,

01:05:07.528 --> 01:05:08.362
I'm going now.

01:05:13.868 --> 01:05:15.995
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
Stop calling it a reason!

01:05:16.078 --> 01:05:18.623
[shouts]
We are telling you that this is your role!

01:05:19.749 --> 01:05:21.042
[mage 1] He can't just leave, can he?

01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.252
[mage 2] He needs to explain his actions
right this minute.

01:05:23.336 --> 01:05:26.547
[mages murmuring]

01:05:33.679 --> 01:05:34.555
What's going on now?

01:05:35.389 --> 01:05:36.557
There's still a soul shifter left?

01:05:39.310 --> 01:05:40.144
Yes, there is.

01:05:41.354 --> 01:05:42.480
Uk will not be returning…

01:05:44.065 --> 01:05:45.274
until he catches that one.

01:06:26.065 --> 01:06:27.900
[leaves rustling]

01:06:47.962 --> 01:06:50.214
["I'm Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:07:17.324 --> 01:07:18.284
So at the end…

01:07:19.994 --> 01:07:22.830
you used my duty to kill soul shifters
as your true reason…

01:07:25.082 --> 01:07:26.333
to call me over here.

01:07:28.711 --> 01:07:30.379
My merciless master.

01:07:33.257 --> 01:07:34.633
How can I be your master…

01:07:36.969 --> 01:07:37.803
when I have…

01:07:40.473 --> 01:07:41.724
already let you go.

01:07:43.976 --> 01:07:45.978
["I'm Sorry" by Ailee continues playing]

01:08:56.966 --> 01:08:59.510
[ominous music playing]

01:09:00.719 --> 01:09:02.763
[footsteps approaching]

01:09:03.973 --> 01:09:06.350
He's over here! Jin Mu is over here!

01:09:07.059 --> 01:09:08.477
Lord Jin Mu! My lord!

01:09:13.732 --> 01:09:14.942
[breathes roughly]

01:09:18.237 --> 01:09:20.322
Wow, you're so close to death.

01:09:24.326 --> 01:09:25.786
- [Yun-o grunts]
- [Jin Mu groans]

01:09:29.290 --> 01:09:31.792
Jin Mu.
Tell me one more thing before you go.

01:09:32.418 --> 01:09:33.794
Is there another Soul Ejector?

01:09:34.378 --> 01:09:36.005
Where is it? Do you have it with you now?

01:09:36.088 --> 01:09:37.590
[groans]

01:09:37.673 --> 01:09:39.925
Keep it together.
Tell me where could it be now!

01:09:42.178 --> 01:09:43.262
[Queen gasps]

01:09:49.643 --> 01:09:52.146
Jin Mu. The Soul Ejector.

01:09:52.229 --> 01:09:53.856
You promised it to me, no?

01:09:53.939 --> 01:09:57.026
Before you die, please hand it over.

01:09:57.109 --> 01:09:58.652
- [breathes roughly]
- [Queen breathes shakily]

01:10:00.654 --> 01:10:01.488
Yes.

01:10:01.572 --> 01:10:03.616
Please tell me! Where is it?

01:10:06.368 --> 01:10:09.914
[in weak voice]
I placed my Soul Ejector inside the…

01:10:12.082 --> 01:10:16.462
the blood of the mage of the Choi family

01:10:17.755 --> 01:10:21.091
who created it in the first place.

01:10:22.509 --> 01:10:24.970
[dramatic music playing]

01:10:27.139 --> 01:10:29.642
The blood… of mine?

01:10:31.644 --> 01:10:33.020
- [knife jabs]
- [Queen grunts]

01:10:35.189 --> 01:10:36.065
[Jin Mu grunts]

01:10:38.400 --> 01:10:39.985
[groaning]

01:10:45.824 --> 01:10:47.826
I placed it inside you

01:10:47.910 --> 01:10:50.704
when I was shifting your soul,
Your Highness.

01:10:51.580 --> 01:10:54.833
I guess you forgot all about that.

01:10:55.584 --> 01:10:57.461
[tense music playing]

01:10:58.587 --> 01:11:00.965
[grunts, groans]

01:11:01.799 --> 01:11:02.675
[Jin Mu grunts]

01:11:04.301 --> 01:11:07.930
[Queen in weak voice]
It is now coming back to me.

01:11:09.181 --> 01:11:11.392
The one who shifted my soul…

01:11:12.810 --> 01:11:13.769
Jin Mu…

01:11:15.437 --> 01:11:16.480
was you!

01:11:22.069 --> 01:11:23.988
[choking]

01:11:24.488 --> 01:11:27.199
[eerie music playing]

01:11:34.290 --> 01:11:35.124
[thuds]

01:11:40.462 --> 01:11:42.464
[ominous music playing]

01:11:52.683 --> 01:11:53.892
My lord.

01:11:53.976 --> 01:11:57.313
I came here so I could rescue you.
Let's leave together.

01:11:57.396 --> 01:11:58.522
That's right.

01:11:59.315 --> 01:12:01.567
You and I
will be leaving this place together.

01:12:02.151 --> 01:12:03.777
- [breathes shakily]
- [Jin Mu] Rather….

01:12:05.279 --> 01:12:07.948
I'll be leaving here in your body.

01:12:19.960 --> 01:12:22.296
[dramatic music playing]

01:12:27.676 --> 01:12:28.510
[gasps]

01:12:30.095 --> 01:12:31.680
[evil laughter]

01:12:36.101 --> 01:12:38.729
[laughing]

01:12:42.858 --> 01:12:44.860
["Blue Flower" by Lia playing]

01:14:06.525 --> 01:14:08.986
[ominous music playing]

01:14:16.493 --> 01:14:17.411
[Sun grunts]

01:14:42.811 --> 01:14:44.062
Have you come back from Gwido?

01:14:44.146 --> 01:14:46.440
Jin Mu, is he alive?

01:14:46.523 --> 01:14:49.568
So you were the one who sent him
to Gwido to save Jin Mu, Sire.

01:14:50.360 --> 01:14:53.864
I could not stop thinking about the power
he had promised me all this time,

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:56.158
or at the very least, how to acquire it.

01:14:56.241 --> 01:14:58.869
So, did you get to see Jin Mu?

01:14:59.995 --> 01:15:01.914
You are looking at him this very moment…

01:15:01.997 --> 01:15:03.624
[dramatic music playing]

01:15:03.707 --> 01:15:04.708
Sire.

01:15:05.626 --> 01:15:06.752
Do you still not get it?

01:15:08.962 --> 01:15:10.172
It's me, Jin Mu.

01:15:15.135 --> 01:15:16.345
You shifted your soul!

01:15:19.056 --> 01:15:20.015
[exhales in delight]

01:15:21.350 --> 01:15:24.645
So, this is the great power
that you promised me.

01:15:24.728 --> 01:15:26.939
If we share the power of the ice stone,

01:15:27.439 --> 01:15:30.150
the strong will be even greater
and live forever.

01:15:33.278 --> 01:15:36.532
Now, come join me and we'll all walk…

01:15:37.574 --> 01:15:40.536
down that glorious path together!

01:15:40.619 --> 01:15:42.663
[dramatic music continues playing]

01:16:04.560 --> 01:16:06.937
[somber music playing]

01:16:44.725 --> 01:16:46.977
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:17:05.912 --> 01:17:08.832
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:09.583 --> 01:17:10.917
[Bu-yeon] I can only say

01:17:11.001 --> 01:17:13.253
one more thing to you in our final moment.

01:17:13.337 --> 01:17:16.256
[Yun-o] Let's go and take the fire bird
from Jinyowon right now.

01:17:16.340 --> 01:17:18.425
- Bring the ice stone to me.
- Majesty!

01:17:18.508 --> 01:17:21.345
Why are you trying to deceive
the King and the Assembly?

01:17:22.054 --> 01:17:24.389
[Heo Yeom] Hey, Uk. Uk, Jin is…

01:17:24.473 --> 01:17:26.475
Jin is… Jin is…

01:17:27.934 --> 01:17:31.938
[Master Lee] I fear the great chaos
may finally be coming for us yet again.

01:17:32.022 --> 01:17:33.023
- [Jang Uk] The fire bird will awaken.
- [screams]

01:17:33.106 --> 01:17:34.941
I was told that would undoubtedly happen.
